@host = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar todos (incluye total_km)
GET {{host}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por vehículo
GET {{host}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por conductor
GET {{host}}/viajes?conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtro inválido (400)
GET {{host}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar viaje
POST {{host}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 1,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-11",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 430,
  "observaciones": "Sin novedades"
}

### Vehículo inexistente (404)
POST {{host}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 9999,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-11",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 430
}

### Actualizar viaje
PUT {{host}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 1,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-12",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 450,
  "observaciones": "Demora por clima"
}

### Eliminar viaje
DELETE {{host}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
